# Normalise line endings in the repository to LF, and check them out as LF on every
# platform. Without this, core.autocrlf on a Windows checkout rewrites text files to
# CRLF in the working tree, so `mvn package` on Windows and on CI produce jars whose
# resources differ byte-for-byte from the same commit — config.yml gained 71 bytes
# that way between two builds of 3.0.0. Harmless to the server, fatal to comparing
# a local build against a CI one by checksum.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries git must never touch.
*.jar  binary
*.zip  binary
*.png  binary
